<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 05:29:42 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>并非如此的 SaaS 末日——Salesforce、Booking 和 IBM 如何利用 AI 蓬勃发展</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/saaspocalypse-salesforce-booking-ibm-sonnenfeld/</link><description>现在 SaaS 末日了吗？更像是一种误导性的恐慌，意外地践踏了这个被误解的行业中坚韧的赢家。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2256811569-e1787802390565.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 03:47:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/saaspocalypse-salesforce-booking-ibm-sonnenfeld/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 首次发布了未来一年的预测——70% 的增长是重磅炸弹，旨在平息人工智能泡沫批评者和“循环融资”末日论者的声音</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/nvidia-q2-growth-results-jensen-huang/</link><description>Nvidia 的股价在盘后交易中上涨了 4% 以上，此前该季度业绩表现强劲，并预计下一财年的收入将比分析师预期高出 1000 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2266567746-e1787786913572.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:39:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/nvidia-q2-growth-results-jensen-huang/</guid></item><item><title>为什么华尔街将 39,800 美元的胰腺癌药物视为更大赌注的证明</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/pancreatic-cancer-fda-approval-pill-doubles-survival-rate-revolution-medicines/</link><description>该开发商的股东丹麦·纳格达(Danish Nagda)博士告诉《财富》杂志，这“令人难以置信地令人兴奋……也许距离后癌症时代还有五年”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2205708766-e1787778879245.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 22:33:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/pancreatic-cancer-fda-approval-pill-doubles-survival-rate-revolution-medicines/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 季度营收翻倍至 960 亿美元，超额完成华尔街增长目标，首席执行官黄仁勋表示需求正在加速</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/nvidia-results-q2-earnings/</link><description>英伟达2027财年第二季度盈利结果在周三收盘后发布。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2192223928-e1787773764871.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 20:27:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/nvidia-results-q2-earnings/</guid></item><item><title>加密货币交易员将多莉·帕顿的死变成了迷因币狂潮</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/crypto-traders-dolly-parton-death-memecoin-frenzy/</link><description>纪念帕顿的代币出现在 Pump.fun 等流行的 memecoin 平台上，但几个小时后就崩溃了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1489255565-e1787780184427.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 21:41:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/crypto-traders-dolly-parton-death-memecoin-frenzy/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 和独立公司发布了有关 Hugging Face 上的流氓 AI 攻击的报告。以下是主要内容，以及 OpenAI 尚未披露的内容。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/openai-publishes-technical-report-on-how-its-agents-hacked-hugging-face-here-are-the-main-takeaways-and-what-openai-left-out/</link><description>OpenAI 表示，其人工智能模型试图解决的一些任务的难度可能导致了导致 Hugging Face 遭受攻击的“流氓”行为。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279687218-e1787767338576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 19:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/openai-publishes-technical-report-on-how-its-agents-hacked-hugging-face-here-are-the-main-takeaways-and-what-openai-left-out/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 对于 78 岁高龄经营庞大商业帝国的建议：“依靠‘更高的智慧’，展现自己最好的一面，不要对周围的人发号施令。”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2024/02/12/dolly-parton-business-advice/</link><description>“我只是尝试把比我聪明的人放在合适的位置上，然后我就继续做我的事。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/GettyImages-1810904373-e1707735826233.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Feb 2024 11:54:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2024/02/12/dolly-parton-business-advice/</guid></item><item><title>前美国商品期货交易委员会委员：华尔街已经使用这些金融合约数十年了。现在牧羊人也这么做了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/cftc-commissioner-brian-quintenz-prediction-markets-kalshi/</link><description>由于预测市场，小型企业有史以来第一次能够使用华尔街多年来使用的风险管理工具。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/quintenz.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 20:36:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/cftc-commissioner-brian-quintenz-prediction-markets-kalshi/</guid></item><item><title>总检察长表示，Meta 的 180 亿美元和解协议忽略了新墨西哥州在审判中已赢得的儿童保护</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/exclusive-new-mexicos-attorney-general-meta-18-billion-settlement-weaker-his-state-raul-torrez/</link><description>劳尔·托雷兹表示，新墨西哥州针对人工智能聊天机器人和掠夺者的保护比国家定居点更强有力。儿童安全专家对此表示赞同。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2261835589-e1787763954969.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:00:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/exclusive-new-mexicos-attorney-general-meta-18-billion-settlement-weaker-his-state-raul-torrez/</guid></item><item><title>不要因为“法院命令他们做什么”而赞扬 Meta：只有 TikTok 和 YouTube 与之匹配，Meta 才会支付全额 171 亿美元和解金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/meta-contingency-settlement-18-billion-tiktok-youtube/</link><description>州总检察长担保 121 亿美元。 Meta 表示，除非竞争对手签约，否则它将保留 53 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1967624978-e1787767082591.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 19:39:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/26/meta-contingency-settlement-18-billion-tiktok-youtube/</guid></item></channel></rss>